  "headHtml": "\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n  <title>NIGHT — PHANTOM Highlight Medley</title>\n  <meta name=\"description\" content=\"Listen to the NIGHT PHANTOM highlight medley and six track previews.\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"assets/css/style.css\">\n",
  "beforeHeaderHtml": "\n  ",
  "contentHtml": "\n\n  <main>\n    <section class=\"medley-hero\">\n      <img class=\"medley-hero-image\" src=\"assets/images/phantom-highlight-medley.webp\" alt=\"NIGHT PHANTOM 하이라이트 메들리 비주얼 — 보랏빛 비 내리는 도시와 수면 위 음파\" fetchpriority=\"high\">\n      <div class=\"medley-hero-shade\"></div>\n      <div class=\"medley-hero-copy container reveal\">\n        <span class=\"section-kicker\">4th Mini Album · PHANTOM</span>\n        <h1>Highlight<br>Medley</h1>\n        <p>현실과 환상의 경계에서 마주한 여섯 개의 잔상.</p>\n        <a class=\"medley-scroll-link\" href=\"#full-medley\">LISTEN TO THE MEDLEY <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</span></a>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"section medley-listen-section\" id=\"full-medley\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"medley-section-head reveal\">\n          <div>\n            <span class=\"section-kicker\">Full Preview</span>\n            <h2 class=\"section-title\">PHANTOM</h2>\n          </div>\n          <p>VEIL부터 REFLECTION까지, 앨범의 흐름을 한 번에 만나보세요.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <article class=\"medley-master reveal\">\n          <div class=\"medley-master-no\">00</div>\n          <div class=\"medley-master-info\">\n            <div class=\"medley-track-meta\"><span>FULL HIGHLIGHT MEDLEY</span><span>01:51</span></div>\n            <h3>PHANTOM — HIGHLIGHT MEDLEY</h3>\n            <audio controls preload=\"metadata\" data-medley-audio>\n              <source src=\"assets/audio/phantom/highlight-medley.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\">\n              Your browser does not support the audio element.\n            </audio>\n          </div>\n        </article>\n\n        <div class=\"medley-track-heading reveal\">\n          <span class=\"section-kicker\">Track Preview</span>\n          <p>각 트랙의 대표 구간을 20초씩 들어보세요.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"medley-track-list\">\n          <article class=\"medley-track reveal\">\n            <div class=\"medley-track-no\">01</div>\n            <div class=\"medley-track-body\">\n              <div class=\"medley-track-meta\"><span>OPENING TRACK</span><span>01:15—01:35</span></div>\n              <h3>VEIL</h3>\n              <audio controls preload=\"metadata\" data-medley-audio><source src=\"assets/audio/phantom/01-veil-highlight.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\"></audio>\n            </div>\n          </article>\n\n          <article class=\"medley-track medley-title-track reveal\">\n            <div class=\"medley-track-no\">02</div>\n            <div class=\"medley-track-body\">\n              <div class=\"medley-track-meta\"><span>TITLE TRACK</span><span>01:02—01:22</span></div>\n              <h3>ILLUSION <em>TITLE</em></h3>\n              <audio controls preload=\"metadata\" data-medley-audio><source src=\"assets/audio/phantom/02-illusion-highlight.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\"></audio>\n            </div>\n          </article>\n\n          <article class=\"medley-track reveal\">\n            <div class=\"medley-track-no\">03</div>\n            <div class=\"medley-track-body\">\n              <div class=\"medley-track-meta\"><span>TRACK 03</span><span>01:09—01:29</span></div>\n              <h3>MOONWATER</h3>\n              <audio controls preload=\"metadata\" data-medley-audio><source src=\"assets/audio/phantom/03-moonwater-highlight.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\"></audio>\n            </div>\n          </article>\n\n          <article class=\"medley-track reveal\">\n            <div class=\"medley-track-no\">04</div>\n            <div class=\"medley-track-body\">\n              <div class=\"medley-track-meta\"><span>TRACK 04</span><span>00:53—01:13</span></div>\n              <h3>AFTERIMAGE</h3>\n              <audio controls preload=\"metadata\" data-medley-audio><source src=\"assets/audio/phantom/04-afterimage-highlight.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\"></audio>\n            </div>\n          </article>\n\n          <article class=\"medley-track reveal\">\n            <div class=\"medley-track-no\">05</div>\n            <div class=\"medley-track-body\">\n              <div class=\"medley-track-meta\"><span>TRACK 05</span><span>01:14—01:34</span></div>\n              <h3>NEON RAIN</h3>\n              <audio controls preload=\"metadata\" data-medley-audio><source src=\"assets/audio/phantom/05-neon-rain-highlight.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\"></audio>\n            </div>\n          </article>\n\n          <article class=\"medley-track reveal\">\n            <div class=\"medley-track-no\">06</div>\n            <div class=\"medley-track-body\">\n              <div class=\"medley-track-meta\"><span>CLOSING TRACK</span><span>03:08—03:28</span></div>\n              <h3>REFLECTION</h3>\n              <audio controls preload=\"metadata\" data-medley-audio><source src=\"assets/audio/phantom/06-reflection-highlight.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\"></audio>\n            </div>\n          </article>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"medley-release reveal\">\n          <span>4TH MINI ALBUM</span>\n          <strong>PHANTOM</strong>\n          <p>2026.09.14 · 6PM KST</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n\n  ",
